---
import StudioShell from '@/components/demos/StudioShell.astro';
import { practices } from '@/content/demos/meridian-advisory/practice';
import './theme.css';
export const prerender = true;
---
<StudioShell slug="meridian-advisory" title="Meridian Advisory — A clearer way forward" description="An Ahmedabad business advisory concept: focused decisions, transparent scopes and an interactive brief builder." theme="#102b29" fonts="/fonts/demos/mogra-house/display.css" links={[{href:'#practice',label:'The practice'},{href:'#method',label:'Our method'},{href:'#brief',label:'Your next chapter'}]}>
  <span slot="wordmark">meridian<span class="ma-mark">↗</span><small>INDEPENDENT ADVISORY</small></span>
  <span slot="nav-cta">Let’s find clarity ↗</span>
  <section class="ma-hero sd-wrap">
    <div class="ma-hero-top sd-eyebrow"><span>Independent thinking. Shared ambition.</span><span>Ahmedabad, India / Studio concept</span></div>
    <h1><span class="sd-hero-line">The next chapter</span><span class="sd-hero-line">starts with a</span><span class="sd-hero-line"><em>clearer question.</em></span></h1>
    <div class="ma-hero-bottom"><span class="ma-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span><p>Thoughtful business advisory for founders building something that matters. Less noise. A considered way forward.</p><a href="#brief" class="ma-round" aria-label="Explore your next chapter">↘</a></div>
    <div class="ma-baseline"><span>STRATEGY</span><span>OPERATIONS</span><span>GROWTH</span><span>01 / SCROLL TO FIND YOUR BEARING</span></div>
  </section>
  <section class="sd-wrap sd-section ma-intro" id="practice"><p class="sd-eyebrow">01 / The practice</p><div><h2>Ambition is a beginning.<br/><em>Direction is a practice.</em></h2><p>You know your business better than anyone. Sometimes the most useful person in the room is the one who can ask a different question.</p><p>This imagined practice works alongside owner-led Indian businesses at moments of change. Every engagement begins with a defined question and ends with something you can use.</p></div></section>
  <section class="ma-services sd-wrap" aria-label="Advisory areas">{practices.map(p=><details class="ma-service"><summary><span class="sd-eyebrow">{p.number}</span><h3>{p.title}</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></summary><div class="ma-service-body"><p>{p.description}</p><div><ul>{p.deliverables.map(d=><li>{d}</li>)}</ul><p class="sd-note">{p.duration}</p></div></div></details>)}</section>
  <section class="sd-section sd-wrap ma-method" id="method"><div class="ma-method-heading"><p class="sd-eyebrow">02 / How clarity happens</p><h2>From a question<br/>to a <em>way forward.</em></h2><p>Three deliberate stages. A working document at every step.</p><span class="ma-method-index" aria-hidden="true">01—03</span></div><div class="ma-method-steps">{[{n:'01',title:'Listen before advising.',body:'Start with the decisions on your desk, the people doing the work and the constraints that do not show up in a presentation.',out:'OUTPUT / A shared problem statement'},{n:'02',title:'Make the choices visible.',body:'Lay out the options, question the assumptions and agree what matters most. Good strategy includes deciding what can wait.',out:'OUTPUT / A decision map'},{n:'03',title:'Leave with a working plan.',body:'Translate the chosen direction into owners, milestones and a review rhythm. A plan belongs in the working week, not on a shelf.',out:'OUTPUT / Your next 90 days'}].map(s=><article class="sd-story-step"><span class="ma-step-number">{s.n}</span><h3>{s.title}</h3><p>{s.body}</p><p class="sd-eyebrow">{s.out}</p></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="ma-brief sd-wrap sd-section" id="brief"><div><p class="sd-eyebrow">03 / A place to begin</p><h2>What’s on<br/><em>your mind?</em></h2><p>Choose the question closest to yours. Unfold a possible starting brief.</p></div><div class="ma-brief-options">{practices.map(p=><details name="advisory-brief" class="ma-brief-option"><summary>{p.question}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div><p class="sd-eyebrow">Your starting point / {p.title}</p><p>{p.description}</p><h3>A first conversation could cover</h3><ul>{p.deliverables.map(d=><li>{d}</li>)}</ul><a href={`/contact?category=Professional%20Services&demo=meridian-advisory&message=${encodeURIComponent('I would like an advisory website with a brief builder like: '+p.question)}`} class="sd-button">Discuss a website like this <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="sd-note">Illustrative engagement, not a consulting offer.</p></div></details>)}</div></section>
  <section class="sd-wrap ma-principles"><p class="sd-eyebrow">A few things worth being clear about</p><div class="sd-grid"><div><h3>Scope before commitment.</h3><p>A written question, agreed deliverables and clear boundaries before work begins.</p></div><div><h3>Your context comes first.</h3><p>Build on the way your business works. Use a tool only when it makes a decision easier.</p></div><div><h3>Judgement, made visible.</h3><p>Explain the reasoning, the tradeoffs and what still needs to be learned.</p></div></div></section>
  <span slot="closing">A little perspective.<br/><em>A lot of possibility.</em></span>
</StudioShell>
